<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef sharply higher on light demand and offerings. Select and Choice loin cuts sharply higher, while the rib cuts firm and the chuck and round cuts higher. Beef trimmings higher on light demand and offerings.-USDA-----</p>
<p>219 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 30 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>16 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     102.55	102.47	 97.15	 96.15</p>
<p>Changes	   2.73	  2.69	  1.91	  1.53</p>
<p>Rib	  163.00	163.26	153.74	153.93</p>
<p>Chuck	 68.11	 67.02	 68.60	 65.90</p>
<p>Round	 86.59	 86.59	 83.99	 83.99</p>
<p>Loin	 165.95	166.95	147.44	146.45</p>
<p>Brisket     61.29	 61.29	 60.20	 60.20</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  65.90	 65.82	 66.14	 65.97</p>
<p>Flank	 57.87	 57.87	 58.08	 58.08</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
